   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Views 1-4 are the four C4 levels, each zooming into the one before (the zoom menu lists what can be drawn on request).\nLater views are extra diagrams: the data, and the states things move through. Numbered pins = places it can crack: red confirmed, orange to verify, blue by design, green fixed.\nPaths start at the project root; ending in / means a folder. Drawn from commit 6847ef6 on 2026-10-16.",
   "originalText": "Views 1-4 are the four C4 levels, each zooming into the one before (the zoom menu lists what can be drawn on request).\nLater views are extra diagrams: the data, and the states things move through. Numbered pins = places it can crack: red confirmed, orange to verify, blue by design, green fixed.\nPaths start at the project root; ending in / means a folder. Drawn from commit 6847ef6 on 2026-10-16.",
   "fontSize": 22,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
